                                "sense_id": "8f0cefe7-facf-397d-9763-03f063ea739d",
                                "text": "Where fires thou find'st unrak'd, and hearths unswept, / There pinch the Maids as blew as Bill-berry, / Our radiant Queene, hates Sluts, and Sluttery."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf9c2158-1309-4cce-9f6a-882efe961527",
                                "sense_id": "8f0cefe7-facf-397d-9763-03f063ea739d",
                                "text": "Home to dinner, and there I took occasion, from the blacknesse of the meat as it came out of the pot, to fall out with my wife and my maid for their sluttery […]"
                            }
                        ]
